' F17 -- Built versus delivered.
' Chapter 6 (Evaluation). Concept diagram.
' Claim supported: what a student can reach is decided by 12 backend flags, all
' default False, of which production switches on four. Since 2026-10-29/30 each
' UI flag is derived from its backend flag, which removed the August half-states;
' two gaps remain where a flag does not say what it seems to.
' Pinned at dfc20df6 (FEATURE_LANDING_PEOPLE removed by PR #175). Sources:
' backend/core/config.py:106-213 (flags), docker-compose.prod.yml:143-154
' (derived VITE flags, 8 of the 12), src/App.tsx:384-395
' (ClassicTool), src/App.tsx:197-212 (StudentV4Redirect), backend/main.py:258
' (search router), backend/services/v4_spaces_service.py:865-899 (Home ask),
' backend/services/review/mastery.py:28-31 (cascade).
@startuml f17-flag-reality
!include _style.iuml

title Built versus delivered — 12 flags, 4 on in production

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 10
}

rectangle "**ON in production** since 2026-10-29/30" as ON #BFBFBF {
  rectangle "FEATURE_V4\nSpaces, Library, Home ask" as V4
  rectangle "FEATURE_V4_READER\nreader: Explain, Ask, practice" as RD
  rectangle "FEATURE_LUNA_SESSIONS\nLuna study sessions" as LS
  rectangle "FEATURE_STUDENT_UPLOADS\nLibrary uploads" as SU
  V4 -[hidden]right- RD
  LS -[hidden]right- SU
  V4 -[hidden]down- LS
}

rectangle "**OFF** — code default" as OFF #F2F2F2 {
  rectangle "REVIEW_ENGINE · EXAM_MODE\nSTUDY_GUIDE · GLOBAL_SEARCH\nASK_LUNA\n//tools of the older interface//" as OFF1
  rectangle "COURSE_BRAIN · STUDIO_PAGES\nLLM_PROMPT_LOGGING\n//backend only//" as OFF2
}

rectangle "**How a flag reaches the screen**" as HOW #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**One switch per feature**\nthe prod build copies each backend flag\ninto its VITE_FEATURE_* build argument\n(8 of the 12 have a UI side)" as SW
  rectangle "**Screens of the older interface**\na student is sent to the current screen\nthat replaced it; an older tool whose\nbackend is off answers 404" as GATE
  SW -[hidden]right- GATE
}

rectangle "**Gaps that remain**" as GAPS #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Flag no longer gates the capability**\nGLOBAL_SEARCH off hides the older\nsearch box, but the same tutor still\nanswers in the ask bar of the\ncurrent interface" as LEAK #DCDCDC
  rectangle "**Silent cascade**\nCOURSE_BRAIN off -> no topics extracted\n-> review cards carry no topic\n-> progress per topic never updates" as CASC #DCDCDC
  LEAK -[hidden]right- CASC
}

LS -[hidden]down- OFF1
OFF1 -[hidden]right- OFF2
OFF1 -[hidden]down- SW
SW -[hidden]down- LEAK

legend bottom
  At 0be0081 (2026-08-18): 7 flags, all off; three screens or buttons rendered while their
  backend was off, so their requests returned 404. Fixed by 6c95041b (10-29) and 28c81ca3 (10-30).
  Shading: dark = on in production · light = built but off · mid = a gap that remains.
endlegend

@enduml
